101
00:08:29,780 --> 00:08:33,840
It was used during World War II by the Americans.

102
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:40,400
It was a spoken code, never written down, and it was developed and used by Navajo

103
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:44,840
Indians. They were called the Navajo Code Talkers.

104
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:49,020
The Navajos created the in their own language.

105
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:53,640
Navajo is hard to learn, and only a few people know it.

106
00:08:53,660 --> 00:08:59,060
So it was pretty certain that the enemy would not be able to understand the Code

107
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:03,620
Talkers. In addition, the Talkers used code words.

108
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:10,720
They called a submarine an iron fish and a small bomb thrown by hand a potato.

109
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:16,880
If they wanted to spell something, they used code words for letters of the alphabet.

110
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:22,620
For instance, the letter A was ant or apple or axe.

111
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:30,860
The Code Talkers worked mostly in the islands in the One or two would be assigned to

