114
00:09:42,580 --> 00:09:46,920
The Code Talkers played an important part in several battles.

115
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:51,620
They helped troops coordinate their movements and attacks.

116
00:09:51,620 --> 00:09:54,160
After the war, the U.S.

117
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:57,920
